REQUIRES: msbuild
XFAIL: *

MSBuild records which files each compile read and wrote (its tracker injects
itself into cl.exe) and skips up-to-date projects on the next build. After
a build under catter, building again compiles nothing.
Known failures: #141 (MSBuild's file tracking misses the compiler).

RUN: %e2e prepare hello %t
RUN: env -u CMAKE_GENERATOR cmake -S %t -B %t/build
RUN: %catter script::cdb -q -o %t/compile_commands.json -- cmake --build %t/build --config Debug
RUN: cmake --build %t/build --config Debug | FileCheck %s

CHECK-NOT: main.cc
CHECK: hello.vcxproj ->
